                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Finally a tactics game that has a bigger area then a 4x4 box to fight in.  \nPros-\n- Being able to capture creatures and choose their upgrade path is really cool.\n- AI seems pretty smart some run away when low HP and try to kite you.   They use ability’s when it hurts you the most.\n- Tons of ability’s to formulate your tactics from.\n- Your town can lvl up and give harder quests which give better creatures and awards.\n- Really big battles unlike most games of this type.\n- Heros also have upgrade paths.\nCons-\n- UI needs some work but is expected in an indie early release game.\n- Some of the graphics could use some work but I’m sure a lot of them are place holders due to being early access.\n\nAll in All the game is fun and can’t wait to see how it turns out in the end.\n",
                        "timestamp_created": 1471978533,
